{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32880","headline":"送罗着作两浙按狱 · 李频","name":"送罗着作两浙按狱","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"使印星车适旧游，陶潜今日在瀛洲。\n科条尽晓三千罪，囹圄应空十二州。\n旧绶有香笼驿马，皇华无暇狎沙鸥。\n归来重过姑苏郡，莫忘题名在虎丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}